/target/
/gen/

# The global macOS gitignore carries `Icon?` (for the custom-folder-icon file).
# On a case-insensitive filesystem that pattern also matches this `icons`
# DIRECTORY, so without this negation the whole icon set is silently skipped
# by `git add` and a fresh clone cannot bundle the app. Git cannot re-include
# a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the directory is un-excluded
# first.
!icons/

# icons/ is committed: `pnpm icon` generates it, but a bundle build needs it
# present and regenerating requires macOS. The 1024px source is not needed.
/icons/icon-source.png
